    "attributes": {
        "action": "Introduce a breast cancer-specific questionnaire for Universal Credit claims",
        "additional_details": "Breast cancer can have a significant impact on physical and mental health. Applying for financial support and being asked about returning to work can cause additional stress.",
        "background": "We want a specific questionnaire for people with breast cancer claiming Universal Credit. It should take into account the physical and mental health impacts of breast cancer.",
